@baseUrl = https://localhost:7072

### 1. List (default paging) → 200, page 1, pageSize 20, totalCount 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
Accept: application/json

### 2. pageSize 1000 → 200, capped to pageSize 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses?page=1&pageSize=1000

### 3. pageSize 0 → 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses?pageSize=0

### 4. Known course (any case) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/cs101

### 5. Unknown but well-formed → 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/XX999

### 6. Malformed code → 400 (fixed from L01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/not-a-code!

### 7. PUT new course → 201 + Location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Introduction to Law", "faculty": "arts", "capacity": 2 }

### 8. Same PUT again → 200, identical body (idempotent)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Introduction to Law", "faculty": "arts", "capacity": 2 }

### 9. PUT missing title → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW201
Content-Type: application/json

{ "faculty": "arts", "capacity": 10 }

### 10. PUT without JSON content type → 415
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW201
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### 11. Enrol → 201 + Location (extra "id" is ignored: over-posting blocked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-123

{ "studentNumber": "20000004", "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### 12. Same enrolment again → 409 already_enrolled
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "20000004" }

### 13. Second student → 201 (capacity 2 now full)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "20000012" }

### 14. Third student → 409 course_full
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "20000020" }

### 15. Invalid student number → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "12345" }

### 16. DELETE → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200

### 17. DELETE again → 404 (same state: still gone → idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/LAW200

### 18. Grading policy from validated options → 200 {maxGrade:20, maxPastDays:30}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grading-policy

### 19. Unhandled exception → 500 ProblemDetails, NO stack trace, has traceId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnostics/boom

### 20. Malicious correlation id → replaced by a generated one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
X-Correlation-Id: this-is-way-too-long-and-has-bad-chars!!!-0123456789012345678901234567890123456789

### 21. Health → 200 Healthy
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 22. OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json